{
  "dct_title_s": "Shapefile of the 1968 Ecological Study for the Twin Cities Metropolitan Area (Composite Intrinsic Suitability)",
  "dct_description_sm": [
    "A digitized version of Ian McHarg's original 1968 Ecological Study for the Twin Cities Metropolitan Area: Composite Intrinsic Suitability. These maps were the basis for the 1969 report An Ecological Study of the Twin Cities Metropolitan Area, which provided a framework for land use planning throughout the metro area."
